---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout current="home" title="404 · 这里没有东西" description="你要找的页面不在这里。">
  <main id="main" class="w-full bg-surface">
    <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-3xl flex-col items-start px-gutter py-section">
      <p class="eyebrow">Lost in the stacks</p>
      <p
        class="mt-space-sm select-none font-display text-[6rem] leading-none text-surface-dim sm:text-[9rem]"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        404
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-space-sm font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight">这条小路通向一片空地。</h1>
      <p class="mt-space-md max-w-lg text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
        可能是我改过地址，也可能是这个链接从来就不存在。要不要回书房坐坐，或者去随记里翻两页？
      </p>
      <div class="mt-space-lg flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-sm">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="/">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">
            auto_stories
          </span>
          <span>回到首页</span>
        </a>
        <a class="btn-secondary" href="/essays/">
          <span>翻翻随记</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">
            arrow_forward
          </span>
        </a>
        <button type="button" class="btn-ghost" data-search-open>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">
            search
          </span>
          <span>搜一搜</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-space-xl w-full border-t border-line pt-space-md">
        <p class="meta">也可以从这里重新出发</p>
        <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-x-space-lg gap-y-1">
          <a
            class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary"
            href="/reading/"
          >
            读听
          </a>
          <a
            class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary"
            href="/photos/"
          >
            影集
          </a>
          <a
            class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary"
            href="/guestbook/"
          >
            留言
          </a>
          <a
            class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary"
            href="/rss.xml"
          >
            RSS
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
